    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "ugh i really dont want to spend 4 hours in the er waiting room just for a shot. i had my last tetanus shot like 5 or 6 years ago i think? is that not recent enough to be worried? it doesn't even really hurt that bad right now, just a bit tender. if i just keep it clean and use the neosporin it should be fine, right?",
